rooms_desc ({"You are standing in the great welcome hall of artherion's house.In every corner is a statue of gold.","This is the living room of artherion's house.On the picture in the corner you can see the wise dryad.As you look out of the window, you can see high mountains and a blue lake. Some deer is jumping around between the trees. There is a sofa standing at the wall and a TV in the corner opposite the picture.","This is the bedroom of artherion's house.You can only enter it, if you're a VERY goodfriend of him. You can see a big bed standing in the eastern part of the room. On the northernwall you can see a very interesting picture.","You see a great, white and clean bathroom.In a corner you can see a shower.","This is the prepare room for Artherion's holy druidishceremonies. On the east door there hangs a golden sickle.","You are standing in the most important roomof Artherions house. In the middle you can seehis druidish stone circle and on the wall there is a picture o f his beautyful wife heavenly.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.","This is a brand new, unfurnished room.  As soon as you see it, youstart imagining interesting ways to decorate it.. it could be anything,a cupboard, a conservatory, an orchard, heaven or hell..A small note in the corner says:  'help build/furnish'.",0,})
